# Week 1
## Day 1
// RPE key: @7 = 3 reps left in the tank, @9 = 1 left, @10 = nothing left. Rate honestly after the set.
Incline Bench Press, Dumbbell / 5x6-10 37.5lb @9+ 120s / progress: dp(2.5lb, 6, 10) / superset: A
Incline Row, Dumbbell / 4x8-12 27.5lb @9+ 120s / progress: dp(2.5lb, 8, 12) / warmup: none / superset: A
// Use the overhead cable attachment, not a pushdown. Sets 1-2 at RIR 1. Set 3 is a drop-set: drop the weight ~20-30% immediately and continue to true failure (RIR 0).
Triceps Extension, Cable / 2x8-12 22.5lb @9+ 75s, 1x8-12 22.5lb @10+ 75s / progress: dp(5lb, 8, 12) / warmup: none
// Sets 1-2 at RIR 1. Set 3 is a finisher set to true failure (RIR 0).
Reverse Fly, Leverage Machine / 2x12-20 55lb @9+ 75s, 1x12-20 55lb @10+ 75s / progress: dp(10lb, 12, 20) / warmup: none / superset: B
// Sets 1-3 at RIR 1. Set 4 is a finisher set to true failure (RIR 0).
Lateral Raise, Dumbbell / 3x12-20 12.5lb @9+ 75s, 1x12-20 12.5lb @10+ 75s / progress: dp(2.5lb, 12, 20) / warmup: none / superset: B

## Day 2
// RPE key: @7 = 3 reps left in the tank, @9 = 1 left, @10 = nothing left. Rate honestly after the set.
Bench Press, Dumbbell / 4x6-10 42.5lb @9+ 120s / progress: dp(2.5lb, 6, 10) / superset: C
Lat Pulldown, Cable / 5x6-10 110lb @9+ 120s / progress: dp(5lb, 6, 10) / warmup: none / superset: C
// Standing, not seated/preacher. Sets 1-2 at RIR 1. Set 3 is a finisher set to true failure (RIR 0).
Bicep Curl, Dumbbell / 2x8-12 20lb @9+ 75s, 1x8-12 20lb @10+ 75s / progress: dp(2.5lb, 8, 12) / warmup: none / superset: D
// Sets 1-3 at RIR 1. Set 4 is a finisher set to true failure (RIR 0).
Lateral Raise, Dumbbell / 3x12-20 12.5lb @9+ 75s, 1x12-20 12.5lb @10+ 75s / warmup: none / superset: D
// Myo-reps: set 1 is the activation set at RIR 3-4; mini-sets of 3-5 reps to near-failure. The 20s timers are the protocol, not a bug. +10lb when the activation set hits 15.
Standing Calf Raise, Leverage Machine / 1x12-15 140lb @7+ 20s, 4x3-5 140lb @10+ 20s / progress: custom() {~ if (completedReps[1] >= 15) { weights += 10lb } ~} / warmup: none

## Day 3
// HINGE, not squat: push hips straight BACK, knees soft and fixed, bar slides down the thighs. Bottom = strong hamstring stretch, always BEFORE the lower back rounds - no need to reach the floor. Stand up by driving hips forward.
// Ramp lift: weeks 1-3 at RIR 4-3-2. It WILL feel too easy - that is the prescription, not a reason to add weight (tendons lag muscle and send no warning signal).
Romanian Deadlift, Barbell / 5x6-10 95lb @8+ 120s / progress: dp(10lb, 6, 10)
Bulgarian Split Squat, Dumbbell / 4x8-12 20lb @9+ 120s / progress: dp(5lb, 8, 12) / warmup: none
// Use the overhead cable attachment, not a pushdown. Set 1 at RIR 1. Set 2 is a drop-set: drop the weight ~20-30% immediately and continue to true failure (RIR 0).
Triceps Extension, Cable / 1x8-12 22.5lb @9+ 75s, 1x8-12 22.5lb @10+ 75s / warmup: none
// Standing, not seated/preacher. Set 1 at RIR 1. Set 2 is a finisher set to true failure (RIR 0).
Bicep Curl, Dumbbell / 1x8-12 20lb @9+ 75s, 1x8-12 20lb @10+ 75s / warmup: none

## Day 4
// RPE key: @7 = 3 reps left in the tank, @9 = 1 left, @10 = nothing left. Rate honestly after the set.
Leg Press, Leverage Machine / 5x6-10 180lb @8+ 120s / progress: dp(10lb, 6, 10)
Seated Leg Curl, Leverage Machine / 4x8-12 85lb @10+ 120s / progress: dp(10lb, 8, 12) / warmup: none
// Set 1 at RIR 1. Set 2 is a finisher set to true failure (RIR 0).
Reverse Fly, Leverage Machine / 1x12-20 55lb @9+ 75s, 1x12-20 55lb @10+ 75s / warmup: none
// Myo-reps: set 1 is the activation set at RIR 3-4; mini-sets of 3-5 reps to near-failure. The 20s timers are the protocol, not a bug.
Standing Calf Raise, Leverage Machine / 1x12-15 140lb @7+ 20s, 3x3-5 140lb @10+ 20s / warmup: none
